{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》復仇戲碼進入白熱化階段，楊茜堯飾演夏無雙為追查亡友7年前遭性侵真相展開連串暗黑佈局。她暗中派人偷拍鄺潔楹與男子親熱片段並以此作為籌碼，表面仗義解圍實則設下無法逃脫天羅地網。這場看似善意5萬元金錢交易背後，隱藏住一個足以摧毀多位女星前途殘酷真相。《玫瑰戰爭》楊茜堯設局掌握鄺潔楹把...</p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》復仇戲碼進入白熱化階段，楊茜堯飾演夏無雙為追查亡友7年前遭性侵真相展開連串暗黑佈局。她暗中派人偷拍鄺潔楹與男子親熱片段並以此作為籌碼，表面仗義解圍實則設下無法逃脫天羅地網。這場看似善意5萬元金錢交易背後，隱藏住一個足以摧毀多位女星前途殘酷真相。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》楊茜堯設局掌握鄺潔楹把柄</h2>\n<p>根據第6集最新預告畫面顯示，夏無雙為追查摯友關子盈當年遭遇，早已針對私生活混亂兼涉及濫藥林安安展開嚴密跟蹤行動。鏡頭直擊她派人成功拍下林安安與一名男子激烈親熱畫面，一旦片段流出勢必令其藝人形象瞬間破滅。夏無雙掌握這個致命秘密後未有即時發難，反而主動出資5萬元買斷影片，以救世主姿態強勢介入這場公關危機。</p>\n<h2>林安安感激落疊承諾任憑夏無雙差遣</h2>\n<p>面對事業隨時盡毀邊緣，林安安誤以為遇上生命中最大貴人，對夏無雙出手相救表現得極度惶恐與感激。她在劇中向對方連番道謝並當場給予承諾：「真係好多謝你啊無雙姐，你以後要我做咩我都會做。」這句發自內心感激宣言正中下懷，林安安完全未察覺經理人藍鳳儀連同自己，經已一步步跌入對方為查明舊案而精心策劃復仇陷阱之中。</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯復仇計劃正式啟動</h2>\n<p>整場風暴源於影后關子盈7年前疑似自殺身亡未解謎團，夏無雙從亡友遺物日記中發現當年悲劇牽涉多位昔日好姊妹。預告中夏無雙在林安安答應報恩後瞬間變臉，直接逼問對方當年是否曾替關子盈倒過一杯飲品，矛頭直指當晚落藥疑雲。這段塵封7年不堪往事再度被揭開，夏無雙誓要藉著拍攝電影《玫瑰》逐一擊破眾人心理防線找出真兇。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚復仇劇情緊湊期待結局大反轉</h2>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》最新預告曝光後迅速引爆網絡熱話，大批觀眾對緊湊懸疑劇情走向表示高度關注。有網民留言直指「楊茜堯眼神真係好有戲」、「5萬蚊買起一個人條命好抵」，對其精湛演技給予極高評價。同時亦有觀眾對當年落藥真相充滿好奇，紛紛推測留言表示「鄺潔楹一定有份參與」、「好想知陳自瑤當晚經歷過咩事」，各界均高度關注後續發展。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454737937431994_9565272536af69eb4112da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-1.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454737937431994_9565272536af69eb4112da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738140117336_20864451646af69eb5db428.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-28’00”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738140117336_20864451646af69eb5db428.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738140117336_20864451646af69eb5db428.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-28’00”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738140117336_20864451646af69eb5db428.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738296812361_6542817916af69eb7b58b0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-5.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454738296812361_6542817916af69eb7b58b0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454739128354052_10440415516af69ebfa4053.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-6.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454739128354052_10440415516af69ebfa4053.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454739812776527_7501364336af69ec6bb613.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-4.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454739812776527_7501364336af69ec6bb613.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454740599344256_2533350186af69ece67aa2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--plyr-35’01”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454740599344256_2533350186af69ece67aa2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454740768448577_13964080346af69ed03c793.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179454740768448577_13964080346af69ed03c793.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945474167956919_13842193566af69ed97ad47.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1112-7.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945474167956919_13842193566af69ed97ad47.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:02:32.050856+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1280,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:45:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:36:29.438150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:56:02.033312+00:00","content_hash":"f5e2b2ebb61853d817eb4e418dd9a23fc3e6b770ddc6716915d6f358d0e2370d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}